---
// CPU Cache hierarchy (L1/L2/L3 vs DRAM 100ns cliff), 64B cache lines (Row vs Col scan), and Branchless CSEL.
const W = 900;
const H = 290;
---
<figure class="ge9a">
  <div class="ge9a-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="CPU memory hierarchy latencies from L1 SRAM at 1 nanosecond down to DRAM at 100 nanoseconds, spatial locality in row-major matrix traversal, and superscalar pipeline behavior.">
      {/* Left panel: Memory latency hierarchy + M2 Row vs Col measurement */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="440" height="262" rx="10" class="ge9a-card" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="ge9a-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. CPU Cache Latency Cliff &amp; Spatial Locality</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Thang độ trễ Cache CPU &amp; tính cục bộ bộ nhớ</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="60" width="128" height="44" rx="6" class="ge9a-box is-ok" />
      <text x="40" y="79" class="ge9a-b-ok">L1 Cache (~1 ns)</text>
      <text x="40" y="96" class="ge9a-m">32–128 KB / core</text>

      <rect x="168" y="60" width="132" height="44" rx="6" class="ge9a-box" />
      <text x="178" y="79" class="ge9a-b">L2 Cache (~4 ns)</text>
      <text x="178" y="96" class="ge9a-m">256 KB–4 MB</text>

      <rect x="310" y="60" width="128" height="44" rx="6" class="ge9a-box is-red" />
      <text x="320" y="79" class="ge9a-b-red">DRAM (~100 ns)</text>
      <text x="320" y="96" class="ge9a-m">100x slower vs L1!</text>

      <rect x="30" y="116" width="408" height="68" rx="6" class="ge9a-box is-ok" />
      <text x="44" y="136" class="ge9a-b-ok">Row-Major Matrix (for r {'{'} for c {'}'}) → 123 µs on Apple M2</text>
      <text x="44" y="155" class="ge9a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Reads preload 8 contiguous int64s per 64B cache line.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đọc theo hàng kéo trọn 8 số int64 liên tiếp trong 1 cache line.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="194" width="408" height="66" rx="6" class="ge9a-box is-red" />
      <text x="44" y="214" class="ge9a-b-red">Column-Major (for c {'{'} for r {'}'}) → 222 µs (~1.8x SLOWER)</text>
      <text x="44" y="233" class="ge9a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>4 KB stride leaps evict fetched cache lines unused!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Nhảy cóc 4 KB mỗi bước khiến CPU bỏ phí 7/8 phần tử vừa tải.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right panel: Instruction pipeline & branch prediction */}
      <rect x="470" y="14" width="416" height="262" rx="10" class="ge9a-card" />
      <text x="486" y="42" class="ge9a-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. CPU Pipeline, Branching &amp; Multicore Cost</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Pipeline lệnh CPU, rẽ nhánh &amp; chi phí đa nhân</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="486" y="60" width="384" height="66" rx="6" class="ge9a-box" />
      <text x="500" y="80" class="ge9a-b">Superscalar Execution (4+ instructions per cycle)</text>
      <text x="500" y="99" class="ge9a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Overlaps stages; mispredicted branches flush pipeline.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>CPU nạp nhiều lệnh nối tiếp; đoán sai nhánh xả sạch pipeline.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="486" y="136" width="384" height="58" rx="6" class="ge9a-box is-ok" />
      <text x="500" y="156" class="ge9a-b-ok">Compiler assist: branchless CSEL / CMOV (Go arm64)</text>
      <text x="500" y="175" class="ge9a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Go 1.27 M2: simple `if` sum compiled to 20 µs branchless!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Go 1.27 M2: lệnh if đơn giản tự biến thành CSEL không nhảy!</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="486" y="204" width="384" height="56" rx="6" class="ge9a-box" />
      <text x="500" y="224" class="ge9a-b">Concurrency ceiling: Amdahl's Law &amp; Cache Coherency</text>
      <text x="500" y="242" class="ge9a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Cross-core L1 invalidation + locks cap parallel scaling.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đồng bộ cache giữa các nhân &amp; lock chặn tốc độ song song.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>DRAM waits cost ~100x an L1 hit, so traversing slices sequentially along 64-byte cache lines doubles matrix throughput on Apple M2 without changing a single Big-O term.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Truy cập thanh RAM chậm gấp ~100 lần chạm L1 cache: chỉ cần đổi thứ tự hai vòng lặp cho thuận chiều bộ nhớ liền kề đã giúp chạy nhanh gần gấp đôi trên Apple M2 mà chẳng cần đổi thuật toán.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ge9a { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .ge9a-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .ge9a svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .ge9a text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .ge9a-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .ge9a-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .ge9a-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .ge9a-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge9a-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge9a-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge9a-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge9a-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .ge9a-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge9a-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge9a-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .ge9a figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
